  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Enhanc. Lean Practices in Supply Chains: Digitaliz.4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create new opportunities for marginalized and underpriviedged communities through educational and growth opportunities. Supply chain management (Lean practices) and Industry 4.0-digitalization from producers to end customer through digital tools (vital for national and global markets competitions and backbone for value creation and employment), increasing competence/application of these methods both in academia and in most indiustries/SMEs  are focused.</narrative>
  </description>
